# Agreement Timeline Calculation

This scope calculates the deadlines for notifying amendments related to government procurement agreements.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementTimeline:
  input entry_into_force_date content date
  input notification_period content duration
  output notification_deadline content date
```

## Notification Deadline

The notification must occur within one month after the entry into force of the agreement.

```catala
scope AgreementTimeline:
  date round down
  definition notification_deadline equals entry_into_force_date + 1 month
```